# AI Usage

## Usage Resume

AI was used to complement some complex or most expensive code writing. There was some autocompletion usage to help the speed into the writing process of code.

**All code and changes made by AI was reviewed by me.**

## Model, Effort Level, Harnesses

Claude Code with Opus 5.5 using medium effort. Built-in skills and configurations created by Laravel startup recommendations.

